">Total ifos dose</td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Apr&#x02013;Jul 1998</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Aug&#x02013;Nov 2000</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Jun&#x02013;Aug 2001</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Oct-Nov 2001</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Case 1</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>Cis</italic> 100 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1 Dox 25 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1&#x02013;3 <italic>Alternating with</italic> Ifos 5 g/m<sup>2</sup>, d1 Dox 25 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1&#x02013;3 <italic>5 cycles total</italic></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Ifos 3.33 g/m<sup>2</sup>, d1&#x02013;4 <italic>5 cycles (#1 at reduced dose)</italic></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Epi 90 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1 <italic>Cis</italic> 									75 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1 <italic>Alternating with</italic> Vinb 5 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1 <italic>Cis</italic> 75 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1 Dac 800 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1 <italic>4 cycles total</italic></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Ifos 3.33 g/m<sup>2</sup>, d1&#x02013;4 <italic> 3 cycles</italic></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Total ifos</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">10 g/m<sup>2</sup></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">60 g/m<sup>2</sup></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">40 g/m<sup>2</sup></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">110 g/m<sup>2</sup></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Jun&#x02013;Oct 2002</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Dec 2002&#x02013;Feb 2003</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Case 2</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Vinc 1.4 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1Ifos 3 g/m<sup>2</sup>, d1&#x02013;3 Dox 20 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1&#x02013;3Etop 150 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1&#x02013;3<sup>10</sup><italic> 6 cycles (#6 at 65% dose)</italic></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Vinc 1 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1Act 0.75 mg/m<sup>2</sup>, d1, 2 Ifos 3 g/m<sup>2</sup> d1, 2 <italic>3 cycles, cyclo-sub- stituted for ifos after #1</italic></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Total ifos</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">51 g/m<sup>2</sup></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">6 g/m<sup>2</sup></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">57 g/m<sup>2</sup></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" rowspan="1"><hr/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Jun&#x02013;Sept 2004</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Case 3</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">VIDE (as above)<sup>10</sup><italic> 4 cycles (reduced dose ifos from #3)</italic></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">Total ifos</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">24 g/m<sup>2</sup></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02014;</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">24 g/m<sup>2</sup></td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>